---
import ResearchLayout from "../../layouts/ResearchLayout.astro";
---
<ResearchLayout title="P6｜Glass Core Evolution｜J 的世界 Research" page="P6" section="GLASS CORE EVOLUTION">
<div class="poster">
 <div class="poster-inner">
  <div class="poster-top"><div class="poster-kicker">P5 · GLASS CORE EVOLUTION</div><div class="poster-title">Glass Core</div><div class="poster-sub">結果，而不是起點。</div><p class="poster-copy">Glass Core 的價值，不是「換一種材料」這麼簡單，而是當封裝、互連與訊號完整性遇到下一個瓶頸後，產業開始重新思考核心基板。</p></div>
  <div class="glass-figure"><div class="glass-stack"><div class="glass-layer"><span>AI Accelerator / Chiplet</span><small>運算</small></div><div class="glass-layer"><span>Advanced Packaging</span><small>整合</small></div><div class="glass-layer glass"><span>Glass Core + TGV</span><small>材料 × 互連</small></div><div class="glass-layer"><span>Build-up / Routing</span><small>訊號傳輸</small></div><div class="glass-layer"><span>System / Board</span><small>平台</small></div></div></div>
  <div class="poster-grid three"><div class="poster-tile"><div class="num">01</div><h3>Glass</h3><p>高平整度與材料特性，提供新的設計空間。</p></div><div class="poster-tile"><div class="num">02</div><h3>TGV</h3><p>垂直導通，是玻璃核心真正需要被驗證的製程環節。</p></div><div class="poster-tile dark"><div class="num">03</div><h3>System</h3><p>最終要看的不是材料本身，而是能否進入封裝與量產。</p></div></div>
  <div class="poster-footer"><strong>GLASS CORE EVOLUTION</strong><span>Glass → TGV → Core Substrate → Packaging → AI</span><span>P5</span></div>
 </div>
</div>
<div class="note"><strong>J 的觀察</strong>Glass Core 要從「概念」走到「產業」，真正值得追蹤的是驗證、製程整合、良率、量產時程與客戶導入。</div>
</ResearchLayout>
